WEBVTT

00:19:30.496 --> 00:19:33.246
Why don't you go watch the stuff that
he made that got him that job?

00:19:33.246 --> 00:19:35.079
There's a good chance you're
going to like that, too.

00:19:35.329 --> 00:19:36.621
And the thing about it is,

00:19:36.621 --> 00:19:41.246
is you're the only person losing by not
checking those things out. Right.

00:19:41.246 --> 00:19:44.579
Like they got your money for Thor, they
got your money for Black Panther.

00:19:44.871 --> 00:19:46.579
The industry is going to be fine.

00:19:47.163 --> 00:19:50.829
You have an opportunity and the world
is going to open up to you

00:19:50.954 --> 00:19:53.871
and you're going to have these moments
of joy in these moments of sadness

00:19:53.871 --> 00:19:56.704
and these moments of exhilaration that
you haven't gotten to have yet.

00:19:57.454 --> 00:19:59.663
And that is fundamentally,
for me at least,

00:19:59.663 --> 00:20:02.038
the beauty of film when the beauty
of art and the beauty of